<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'The workshop' }) %>

<div class="wrap section narrow">
  <div class="eyebrow">The workshop</div>
  <h1>Made from what other people threw away</h1>

  <p><%= settings.intro %></p>

  <p>A spanner that snapped becomes a pair of hind legs. A shower rose too limed
  up to use becomes the head of a spider. Everything is cut, welded, filed and
  painted by hand, one piece at a time, which is why the shelves are never very
  full and why no two creatures are quite the same.</p>

  <p>If you want something particular — a beetle in a certain colour, a piece
  built around an object with a story attached to it — write to
  <a href="mailto:<%= settings.contact_email %>"><%= settings.contact_email %></a>
  and it can usually be done.</p>

  <img src="/uploads/group.jpg" alt="Three metal insects" style="border:1px solid var(--rule);margin-top:34px">

  <h2 style="margin-top:48px">Looking after your piece</h2>
  <p>Dust with a dry brush. Keep indoors or in a covered porch — the finishes are
  lacquered but the steel underneath will happily rust if it is left in the rain.
  The legs can be gently bent back into place if a piece takes a knock.</p>

  <p style="margin-top:34px"><a class="btn" href="/shop">See what's available</a></p>
</div>

<%- include('partials/foot') %>
